            "name": "Plan Pending Cost Query"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1772598922435"
          },
          "code": "PLAN_PENDING_COST_QUERY",
          "id": "1772598813605",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772598813607_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "ROLE\nYou are the execution planner for pending capitalization cost requests.\n\nYour only job is to decide whether the already-resolved QUERY request should:\n- use the shared cached presenter route,\n- call API,\n- or ask the user for missing required scope.\n\nReturn exactly one valid JSON object. Do not return prose, markdown, or code fences.\n\nINPUTS\n- branch: {{$context.$nodes.ROUTE_USER_INTENT.$output.branch}}\n- request: {{$context.$nodes.ROUTE_USER_INTENT.$output.request}} \n- projectInput:{{$context.$variables.prjPjcVarConvCurrentProjectDetails.projectNumber}} or {{$context.$nodes.ROUTE_USER_INTENT.$output.request.scope.projectInput}}\n- resolvedUserQuery: {{$context.$nodes.ROUTE_USER_INTENT.$output.resolvedUserQuery}}\n- routerMissingInfo: {{$context.$nodes.ROUTE_USER_INTENT.$output.missingInfo}}\n- prjPjcVarConvLastDataBlock: {{$context.$variables.prjPjcVarConvLastDataBlock}}\n- prjPjcVarConvLatestTransactionSummary: {{$context.$variables.prjPjcVarConvLatestTransactionSummary}}\n- prjPjcVarConvCurrentProjectDetails: {{$context.$variables.prjPjcVarConvCurrentProjectDetails}}\n\nALLOWED DECISIONS\n- USE_LAST_DATABLOCK\n- CALL_API\n- ASK_USER\n\nIMPORTANT DECISION SEMANTICS\n- `USE_LAST_DATABLOCK` means route to the shared cached-result presenter path.\n- It does not mean the answer must come from validation-style `prjPjcVarConvLastDataBlock`.\n- The actual cached content source is determined by `cacheDirective.viewType`:\n  - `TRANSACTION_SUMMARY` -> use `prjPjcVarConvLatestTransactionSummary`\n  - `VALIDATION_ISSUE_GROUPS` or `VALIDATION_ISSUE_DETAILS` -> use `prjPjcVarConvLastDataBlock`\n\nBOUNDARIES\n- Trust the router for top-level meaning.\n- Do not re-classify branch intent.\n- Do not regenerate clarification.\n- Use structured request fields as the primary control surface.\n- Use resolvedUserQuery only as fallback.\n- Do not build BV payloads.\n- Do not fetch data.\n- Cache reuse must require strict business-type and scope match.\n- Never treat a merely related prior result as cache-sufficient.\n\nPRECHECK\n- If branch is not QUERY, return:\n  - decision = ASK_USER\n  - reason = unsupportedBranchForPlanner\n  - executionMode = UNKNOWN\n  - missingInfo = []\n  - identifierValidation.decision = NONE\n  - identifierValidation.queue = []\n  - cacheDirective.eligible = false\n  - cacheDirective.viewType = UNKNOWN\n\nNORMALIZATION\n1. projectInput\nPROJECT INPUT RESOLUTION RULE\n- Determine projectInput using the following priority order:\n\n  1. If request.scope.projectInput is a non-empty string:\n     - Use request.scope.projectInput\n\n  2. Else if prjPjcVarConvCurrentProjectDetails.projectNumber is a non-empty string:\n     - Use prjPjcVarConvCurrentProjectDetails.projectNumber as projectInput\n  3. Else:\n     - Treat projectInput as null\n\n- Trim whitespace from all values before evaluation.\n- Do not use resolvedUserQuery or any other field to infer projectInput.\n\n2. taskInput\n- Use request.scope.taskInput first.\n- Otherwise, if request.target.kind = TASK and request.target.value is a non-empty string, use that.\n- Otherwise null.\n\n3. normalizedRouterMissingInfo\n- Keep only:\n  - projectNameOrNumberRequired\n  - taskIdentifierRequired\n- Deduplicate while preserving order.\n\n4. normalizedTransactionNumbers\n- Use request.scope.transactionNumbers.\n- Deduplicate while preserving order.\n- Maximum 50.\n\n5. normalizedFilters\n- Use request.filters exactly as structured by the router.\n- Keep:\n  - transactionSource\n  - dateFrom\n  - dateTo\n  - minAmount\n  - additionalFilters\n- Do not reinterpret user language here.\n\n6. normalizedGroupBy\n- Use request.presentation.groupBy\n- If empty or invalid, use none.\n\n7. refreshRequested\n- Use request.presentation.refreshRequested exactly.\n\n8. effectiveScope\neffectiveScope is the single source of truth for downstream execution.\nIt must represent the full currently resolved business subset for this request.\n\neffectiveScope contains:\n- projectInput\n- taskInput\n- transactionNumbers\n- filters\n- groupBy\n- refreshRequested\n\nRules:\n- If the router resolved a row into a task, transaction source, or other filter, effectiveScope must contain only the resolved scope, not the old abstract row reference.\n- If request.requestType = PENDING_COST_FILTERED_LIST, effectiveScope must include all narrowing task or filter values.\n- effectiveScope.filters are cumulative and additive.\n- If multiple filters are present, keep all of them.\n- Grouping does not replace scope. Grouping operates over effectiveScope.\n- effectiveScope is the only scope object downstream nodes should use.\n\nCACHE NORMALIZATION\nvalidation cache\n- prjPjcVarConvLastDataBlock may be object or JSON string.\n- If parsing fails, validation cache is unavailable.\n- Validation cache is usable only when:\n  - it is an object\n  - groups is an array\n  - at least one group contains one or more of:\n    sNo, shortIssueText, completeIssueText, transactionNumbers, detailedGuidance, detailedTransactionDetails\n\ntransaction summary cache\n- prjPjcVarConvLatestTransactionSummary may be array or JSON string.\n- If parsing fails, summary cache is unavailable.\n- Summary cache is usable only when it becomes an array with at least one object row.\n\nCURRENT PROJECT MATCH NORMALIZATION\n- Treat prjPjcVarConvCurrentProjectDetails as usable project context only when it is an object.\n- Derive currentProjectNumber from prjPjcVarConvCurrentProjectDetails.projectNumber when non-empty.\n- Derive currentProjectName from prjPjcVarConvCurrentProjectDetails.projectName when non-empty.\n- projectMatchesCurrentProject is true only when projectInput is non-empty and exactly matches currentProjectNumber or currentProjectName.\n- If project match cannot be established safely, treat it as not matched.\n\nEXECUTION MODE INFERENCE\nUse structured request first.\n\n- request.requestType = PENDING_COST_GROUP_SUMMARY -> SUMMARY\n- request.requestType = PENDING_COST_LIST -> FILTERED_LIST\n- request.requestType = PENDING_COST_FILTERED_LIST and taskInput is non-null -> TASK_DRILL\n- request.requestType = PENDING_COST_FILTERED_LIST -> FILTERED_LIST\n- request.requestType = VALIDATION_INSPECTION -> VALIDATION_INSPECTION\n- otherwise -> UNKNOWN\n\nSTRICT CACHE TYPE MATCHING\n- Do not use validation cache for pending-cost retrieval requests.\n- If request.requestType is one of:\n  - PENDING_COST_LIST\n  - PENDING_COST_FILTERED_LIST\n  then:\n  - validation cache is not eligible\n  - VALIDATION_ISSUE_GROUPS and VALIDATION_ISSUE_DETAILS must not be used as cacheDirective.viewType\n\nVALIDATION INSPECTION FACT RULE\n- If request.requestType = VALIDATION_INSPECTION and the user is asking a direct fact question about transactions shown in the latest validation result, cache reuse is eligible only through validation cache.\n- In this case:\n  - cacheDirective.viewType must be VALIDATION_ISSUE_GROUPS\n  - do not use TRANSACTION_SUMMARY\nINVALID CACHE TYPE COMBINATION GUARD\n- The following combinations are invalid and must never be returned:\n  - request.requestType = PENDING_COST_LIST with cacheDirective.viewType = VALIDATION_ISSUE_GROUPS\n  - request.requestType = PENDING_COST_FILTERED_LIST with cacheDirective.viewType = VALIDATION_ISSUE_GROUPS\n  - request.requestType = PENDING_COST_LIST with cacheDirective.viewType = VALIDATION_ISSUE_DETAILS\n  - request.requestType = PENDING_COST_FILTERED_LIST with cacheDirective.viewType = VALIDATION_ISSUE_DETAILS\n- If such a combination would otherwise occur, return CALL_API instead.\n\n\n- PENDING_COST_GROUP_SUMMARY may reuse only transaction summary cache.\n- VALIDATION_INSPECTION may reuse only validation cache.\n\nPROJECT MATCH RULE\n- If request.requestType is PENDING_COST_GROUP_SUMMARY or PENDING_COST_FILTERED_LIST:\n  - If projectInput is explicitly present, cache is eligible only when the cached result clearly belongs to the same project.\n  - If project match cannot be established safely, decision must be CALL_API for any request that would otherwise rely on cache.\n  - request.resolution.mode = followUp is not sufficient for cache reuse.\n\n- If request.requestType is VALIDATION_INSPECTION:\n  - Do not require projectInput when the request is only redisplaying or drilling into the latest validation result.\n  - If projectInput is explicitly present, cache is eligible only when the cached result clearly belongs to the same project.\n  - If projectInput is null, validation cache may still be eligible when the latest validation cache is usable and the request adds no new narrowing.\n\nREDISPLAY-ONLY CACHE ELIGIBILITY\nRoute to USE_LAST_DATABLOCK only when cache can satisfy the current request without fresh retrieval.\n\nCache is eligible when:\n\nA. summary redisplay\n- request.requestType = PENDING_COST_GROUP_SUMMARY\n- request.resolution.mode = cacheInspection\n- refreshRequested is false\n- transaction summary cache is usable\n- if projectInput is non-null, projectMatchesCurrentProject is true\n- normalizedGroupBy = transactionSource\n- cacheDirective.viewType = TRANSACTION_SUMMARY\n\n\nB. validation inspection\n- request.requestType = VALIDATION_INSPECTION\n- refreshRequested is false\n- validation cache is usable\n- cacheDirective.viewType = VALIDATION_ISSUE_GROUPS\n\nProject rule for validation inspection:\n- if projectInput is non-null, projectMatchesCurrentProject must be true\n- if projectInput is null, cache reuse is still allowed only when:\n  - taskInput is null\n  - transactionNumbers is empty\n  - filters.transactionSource is null\n  - filters.additionalFilters is empty\n  - minAmount is null\n\nValidation-inspection fact questions\n- If request.requestType = VALIDATION_INSPECTION and the request is a direct fact question about the transactions shown in the latest validation result:\n  - refreshRequested is false\n  - validation cache is usable\n  - cacheDirective.viewType = VALIDATION_ISSUE_GROUPS\n  - if projectInput is non-null, projectMatchesCurrentProject is true\n  - if projectInput is null, cache reuse is allowed only when no new narrowing is introduced\n\n\nDIRECT FACT QUESTION CACHE RULE\n- For VALIDATION_INSPECTION requests that ask fact questions directly answerable from cached transaction details:\n  - cache may be reused only when validation cache is usable, and\n  - the answer is directly supported by cached transaction details or a safe aggregate over those rows, and\n  - if projectInput is non-null, projectMatchesCurrentProject is true\n- Otherwise do not reuse cache.\n\nMANDATORY VALIDATION REDISPLAY RULE\n- If request.requestType = VALIDATION_INSPECTION\n- and refreshRequested is false\n- and validation cache is usable\n- and projectInput is null\n- and taskInput is null\n- and transactionNumbers is empty\n- and filters.transactionSource is null\n- and filters.additionalFilters is empty\n- and minAmount is null\n- then you MUST return:\n  - decision = USE_LAST_DATABLOCK\n  - reason = validationCacheRedisplay\n  - executionMode = VALIDATION_INSPECTION\n  - missingInfo = []\n  - identifierValidation.decision = NONE\n  - identifierValidation.queue = []\n  - cacheDirective.eligible = true\n  - cacheDirective.viewType = VALIDATION_ISSUE_GROUPS\n- In this case, do not return ASK_USER.\n- In this case, do not return projectNameOrNumberRequired.\n- In this case, do not return CALL_API.\n\n\nASK_USER GUARD FOR VALIDATION INSPECTION\n- For request.requestType = VALIDATION_INSPECTION, do not ask for projectNameOrNumberRequired when:\n  - validation cache is usable, and\n  - the request is only redisplaying or drilling into the latest validation result, and\n  - no new narrowing is introduced\n- In that case, the only valid decision is USE_LAST_DATABLOCK.\n\nSTRICT FRESH-QUERY RULE\n- Never return USE_LAST_DATABLOCK when effectiveScope contains explicit narrowing beyond simple redisplay.\n- If taskInput is non-null, CALL_API.\n- If transactionNumbers is non-empty, CALL_API.\n- If filters.transactionSource is non-null, CALL_API.\n- If filters.additionalFilters contains one or more keys, CALL_API.\n- If minAmount is non-null, CALL_API.\n- If dateFrom or dateTo is non-null, CALL_API.\n- If a summary row has already been resolved into explicit scope, CALL_API.\n- If request.requestType is PENDING_COST_LIST or PENDING_COST_FILTERED_LIST, and cache is validation-shaped, CALL_API.\n- If the current request is an explicit new project request and projectMatchesCurrentProject is false, CALL_API.\n- If normalizedGroupBy is not transactionSource, CALL_API.\n\nISSUE GROUP OVERRIDE\n- If request.target.kind = ISSUE_GROUP:\n  - cacheDirective.eligible = true\n  - cacheDirective.viewType = VALIDATION_ISSUE_GROUPS\nIDENTIFIER VALIDATION RULES\nApply only when final decision = CALL_API.\n\n1. Start with empty queue.\n\n2. If projectInput is non-empty:\n- append { \"entity\": \"PROJECT\", \"value\": projectInput }\n\n3. If projectMatchesCurrentProject is true:\n- identifierValidation.decision = NONE\n- queue = []\n\n4. Else if executionMode = TASK_DRILL and taskInput is non-empty:\n- append { \"entity\": \"TASK\", \"value\": taskInput }\n\n5. If queue is empty:\n- identifierValidation.decision = NONE\n- queue = []\n\n6. Else:\n- identifierValidation.decision = REQUIRED\n- queue = queue\n\nDECISION RULES\nApply in exact order.\n\n1. If branch is not QUERY:\n- decision = ASK_USER\n- reason = unsupportedBranchForPlanner\n- missingInfo = []\n\n2. If normalizedRouterMissingInfo is non-empty:\n- decision = ASK_USER\n- reason = routerMissingInfo\n- missingInfo = normalizedRouterMissingInfo\n\n3. If request.target.kind = ISSUE_GROUP:\n- decision = USE_LAST_DATABLOCK\n- reason = cacheSufficient\n- missingInfo = []\n\n4. If projectInput is null:\n- decision = ASK_USER\n- reason = needProjectIdentifier\n- missingInfo = [\"projectNameOrNumberRequired\"]\n\n5. If executionMode = TASK_DRILL and taskInput is null:\n- decision = ASK_USER\n- reason = taskIdentifierMissing\n- missingInfo = [\"taskIdentifierRequired\"]\n\n6. If request.requestType = PENDING_COST_GROUP_SUMMARY and normalizedGroupBy is not transactionSource:\n- decision = CALL_API\n- reason = needFreshQuery\n- missingInfo = []\n\n7. If cache is eligible:\n- decision = USE_LAST_DATABLOCK\n- reason = cacheSufficient\n- missingInfo = []\n\n8. Otherwise:\n- decision = CALL_API\n- reason = needFreshQuery\n- missingInfo = []\n\nOUTPUT JSON SCHEMA\n{\n  \"decision\": \"USE_LAST_DATABLOCK | CALL_API | ASK_USER\",\n  \"reason\": \"cacheSufficient | routerMissingInfo | needProjectIdentifier | taskIdentifierMissing | needFreshQuery | unsupportedBranchForPlanner\",\n  \"resolvedUserQuery\": \"\",\n  \"executionMode\": \"SUMMARY | FILTERED_LIST | TASK_DRILL | VALIDATION_INSPECTION | UNKNOWN\",\n  \"cacheDirective\": {\n    \"eligible\": false,\n    \"viewType\": \"TRANSACTION_SUMMARY | VALIDATION_ISSUE_GROUPS | VALIDATION_ISSUE_DETAILS | UNKNOWN\"\n  },\n  \"missingInfo\": [],\n  \"identifierValidation\": {\n    \"decision\": \"REQUIRED | NONE\",\n    \"queue\": [\n      { \"entity\": \"PROJECT | TASK\", \"value\": \"string\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"normalizedExecution\": {\n    \"projectInput\": null,\n    \"taskInput\": null,\n    \"requestType\": \"PENDING_COST_LIST | PENDING_COST_GROUP_SUMMARY | PENDING_COST_FILTERED_LIST | VALIDATION_INSPECTION | UNKNOWN\",\n    \"executionMode\": \"SUMMARY | FILTERED_LIST | TASK_DRILL | VALIDATION_INSPECTION | UNKNOWN\",\n    \"effectiveScope\": {\n      \"projectInput\": null,\n      \"taskInput\": null,\n      \"transactionNumbers\": [],\n      \"filters\": {\n        \"transactionSource\": null,\n        \"dateFrom\": null,\n        \"dateTo\": null,\n        \"minAmount\": null,\n        \"additionalFilters\": {}\n      },\n      \"groupBy\": \"transactionSource | task | expenditureType | documentName | documentEntryName | businessUnitName | salesOrderNumber | shipmentNumber | workOrderNumber | invoiceNumber | receiptNumber | purchaseOrderNumber | paymentNumber | transferOrderNumber | none\",\n      \"refreshRequested\": false\n    }\n  },\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"viewQueries\": {},\n    \"select\": \"\",\n    \"return\": []\n  }\n}\n\nOUTPUT VALIDITY GUARDS\n- Return exactly one JSON object and nothing else.\n- payload must remain empty in this node.\n- normalizedExecution.effectiveScope is the full downstream source of truth.\n- Do not return CALL_API with non-empty missingInfo.\n- Do not return CALL_API when projectInput is null.\n- Do not reuse validation cache for pending-cost retrieval requests.\n- Do not reuse cache when project scope cannot be safely matched."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"decision\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"USE_LAST_DATABLOCK\",\n        \"CALL_API\",\n        \"ASK_USER\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"reason\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"cacheSufficient\",\n        \"routerMissingInfo\",\n        \"needProjectIdentifier\",\n        \"taskIdentifierMissing\",\n        \"needFreshQuery\",\n        \"unsupportedBranchForPlanner\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"resolvedUserQuery\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"executionMode\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"SUMMARY\",\n        \"FILTERED_LIST\",\n        \"TASK_DRILL\",\n        \"VALIDATION_INSPECTION\",\n        \"UNKNOWN\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"cacheDirective\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"eligible\": {\n          \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"viewType\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"TRANSACTION_SUMMARY\",\n            \"VALIDATION_ISSUE_GROUPS\",\n            \"VALIDATION_ISSUE_DETAILS\",\n            \"UNKNOWN\"\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"eligible\",\n        \"viewType\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"missingInfo\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"identifierValidation\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"decision\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"REQUIRED\",\n            \"NONE\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"queue\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": false,\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"entity\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"enum\": [\n                  \"PROJECT\",\n                  \"TASK\"\n                ]\n              },\n              \"value\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n              \"entity\",\n              \"value\"\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"decision\",\n        \"queue\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"normalizedExecution\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"projectInput\": {\n          \"type\": [\n            \"string\",\n            \"null\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"taskInput\": {\n          \"type\": [\n            \"string\",\n            \"null\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"requestType\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"PENDING_COST_LIST\",\n            \"PENDING_COST_GROUP_SUMMARY\",\n            \"PENDING_COST_FILTERED_LIST\",\n            \"VALIDATION_INSPECTION\",\n            \"UNKNOWN\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"executionMode\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"SUMMARY\",\n            \"FILTERED_LIST\",\n            \"TASK_DRILL\",\n            \"VALIDATION_INSPECTION\",\n            \"UNKNOWN\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"effectiveScope\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"additionalProperties\": false,\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"projectInput\": {\n              \"type\": [\n                \"string\",\n                \"null\"\n              ]\n            },\n            \"taskInput\": {\n              \"type\": [\n                \"string\",\n                \"null\"\n              ]\n            },\n            \"transactionNumbers\": {\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"items\": {\n                \"type\": [\n                  \"integer\",\n                  \"string\"\n                ]\n              }\n            },\n            \"filters\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"additionalProperties\": false,\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"transactionSource\": {\n                  \"type\": [\n                    \"string\",\n                    \"null\"\n                  ]\n                },\n                \"dateFrom\": {\n                  \"type\": [\n                    \"string\",\n                    \"null\"\n                  ]\n                },\n                \"dateTo\": {\n                  \"type\": [\n                    \"string\",\n                    \"null\"\n                  ]\n                },\n                \"minAmount\": {\n                  \"type\": [\n                    \"number\",\n                    \"integer\",\n                    \"null\"\n                  ]\n                },\n                \"additionalFilters\": {\n                  \"type\": \"object\"\n                }\n              },\n              \"required\": [\n                \"transactionSource\",\n                \"dateFrom\",\n                \"dateTo\",\n                \"minAmount\",\n                \"additionalFilters\"\n              ]\n            },\n            \"groupBy\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"enum\": [\n                \"transactionSource\",\n                \"task\",\n                \"expenditureType\",\n                \"documentName\",\n                \"documentEntryName\",\n                \"businessUnitName\",\n                \"salesOrderNumber\",\n                \"shipmentNumber\",\n                \"workOrderNumber\",\n                \"invoiceNumber\",\n                \"receiptNumber\",\n                \"purchaseOrderNumber\",\n                \"paymentNumber\",\n                \"transferOrderNumber\",\n                \"none\"\n              ]\n            },\n            \"refreshRequested\": {\n              \"type\": \"boolean\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"projectInput\",\n            \"taskInput\",\n            \"transactionNumbers\",\n            \"filters\",\n            \"groupBy\",\n            \"refreshRequested\"\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"projectInput\",\n        \"taskInput\",\n        \"requestType\",\n        \"executionMode\",\n        \"effectiveScope\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"payload\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"viewQueries\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\"\n        },\n        \"select\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"return\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"viewQueries\",\n        \"select\",\n        \"return\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"decision\",\n    \"reason\",\n    \"resolvedUserQuery\",\n    \"executionMode\",\n    \"cacheDirective\",\n    \"missingInfo\",\n    \"identifierValidation\",\n    \"normalizedExecution\",\n    \"payload\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
